{
  "kind": "app",
  "name": "amm",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "programs": {
    "overlay": "bin/overlay.wasm",
    "mandala-topic": "bin/mandala-topic.wasm",
    "mandala-lookup": "bin/mandala-lookup.wasm",
    "amm-lookup": "bin/amm-lookup.wasm",
    "amm-p2p": "bin/amm-p2p.wasm",
    "amm-validator": "bin/amm-validator.wasm"
  },
  "config": {
    "overlay": {
      "lookups": {
        "ls_mandala": {
          "program": "mandala-lookup"
        },
        "ls_mandala_deploys": {
          "program": "mandala-lookup"
        },
        "ls_amm": {
          "program": "amm-lookup"
        }
      }
    },
    "amm": {
      "ammP2p": {
        "heartbeatSeconds": 30,
        "offlineSeconds": 40,
        "market": false
      },
      "ammValidator": {
        "minValidatorFeeBps": 5,
        "maxLpFeeBps": 100,
        "maxCommissionBps": null
      },
      "commission": {
        "pkh": null
      }
    }
  },
  "provides": [
    {
      "interface": "amm.swap/1",
      "functions": {
        "submit": {
          "writes": true,
          "args": {
            "funding": "bytes",
            "swap": "bytes",
            "pool": "string",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "peerId": "string",
            "expires": "ms"
          },
          "answer": {
            "id": "string",
            "status": "string",
            "funding": "bytes",
            "swap": "bytes",
            "pool": "string",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "expires": "ms",
            "created": "ms",
            "updated": "ms",
            "tx?": "bytes",
            "txid?": "string",
            "reason?": "string",
            "detail?": "string",
            "poolState?": "map"
          }
        },
        "status": {
          "writes": false,
          "args": {
            "id": "string"
          },
          "answer": {
            "id": "string",
            "status": "string",
            "funding": "bytes",
            "swap": "bytes",
            "pool": "string",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "expires": "ms",
            "created": "ms",
            "updated": "ms",
            "tx?": "bytes",
            "txid?": "string",
            "reason?": "string",
            "detail?": "string",
            "poolState?": "map"
          }
        },
        "terms": {
          "writes": false,
          "args": {},
          "answer": {
            "commissionPkh?": "bytes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "interface": "amm.pool/1",
      "functions": {
        "submit": {
          "writes": true,
          "args": {
            "funding": "bytes",
            "deploy": "bytes",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "peerId": "string",
            "expires": "ms"
          },
          "answer": {
            "id": "string",
            "status": "string",
            "funding": "bytes",
            "deploy": "bytes",
            "pool": "string",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "expires": "ms",
            "created": "ms",
            "updated": "ms",
            "tx?": "bytes",
            "txid?": "string",
            "reason?": "string",
            "detail?": "string"
          }
        },
        "status": {
          "writes": false,
          "args": {
            "id": "string"
          },
          "answer": {
            "id": "string",
            "status": "string",
            "funding": "bytes",
            "deploy": "bytes",
            "pool": "string",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "expires": "ms",
            "created": "ms",
            "updated": "ms",
            "tx?": "bytes",
            "txid?": "string",
            "reason?": "string",
            "detail?": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "interface": "amm.liquidity/1",
      "functions": {
        "submit": {
          "writes": true,
          "args": {
            "funding": "bytes",
            "add": "bytes",
            "pool": "string",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "peerId": "string",
            "expires": "ms"
          },
          "answer": {
            "id": "string",
            "status": "string",
            "funding": "bytes",
            "add": "bytes",
            "pool": "string",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "expires": "ms",
            "created": "ms",
            "updated": "ms",
            "tx?": "bytes",
            "txid?": "string",
            "reason?": "string",
            "detail?": "string",
            "poolState?": "map"
          }
        },
        "status": {
          "writes": false,
          "args": {
            "id": "string"
          },
          "answer": {
            "id": "string",
            "status": "string",
            "funding": "bytes",
            "add": "bytes",
            "pool": "string",
            "validator": "bytes",
            "expires": "ms",
            "created": "ms",
            "updated": "ms",
            "tx?": "bytes",
            "txid?": "string",
            "reason?": "string",
            "detail?": "string",
            "poolState?": "map"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "requires": [
    "chain/1"
  ],
  "dispatch": [
    {
      "address": "register",
      "sender": "$owner",
      "program": "overlay"
    },
    {
      "address": "validate",
      "sender": "$owner",
      "program": "amm-p2p"
    },
    {
      "address": "",
      "sender": "event",
      "program": "overlay"
    },
    {
      "address": "",
      "sender": "$self",
      "program": "overlay"
    },
    {
      "address": "",
      "sender": "*",
      "program": "amm-p2p"
    },
    {
      "address": "amm-p2p",
      "sender": "*",
      "program": "amm-p2p"
    },
    {
      "address": "submit",
      "sender": "*",
      "program": "overlay",
      "filter": "beef"
    },
    {
      "transport": "http",
      "address": "/call",
      "sender": "*",
      "program": "amm-p2p",
      "fn": "call"
    },
    {
      "transport": "libp2p",
      "address": "/amm-validator/1/swap",
      "sender": "*",
      "program": "amm-validator",
      "fn": "swap"
    },
    {
      "transport": "libp2p",
      "address": "/amm-validator/1/addLiquidity",
      "sender": "*",
      "program": "amm-validator",
      "fn": "addLiquidity"
    },
    {
      "transport": "libp2p",
      "address": "/amm-validator/1/deploy",
      "sender": "*",
      "program": "amm-validator",
      "fn": "deploy"
    }
  ],
  "reads": [
    {
      "address": "/listTopicManagers",
      "program": "overlay",
      "fn": "listTopicManagers"
    },
    {
      "address": "/listLookupServiceProviders",
      "program": "overlay",
      "fn": "listLookupServiceProviders"
    },
    {
      "address": "/getDocumentationForTopicManager",
      "program": "overlay",
      "fn": "topicDocumentation"
    },
    {
      "address": "/getDocumentationForLookupServiceProvider",
      "program": "overlay",
      "fn": "lookupDocumentation"
    },
    {
      "address": "/",
      "prefix": true,
      "program": "amm-p2p",
      "fn": "serve",
      "root": "www",
      "index": "index.html"
    }
  ],
  "start": {
    "body": {
      "kind": "amm-p2p-start"
    }
  },
  "stop": {
    "body": {
      "kind": "amm-p2p-stop"
    }
  },
  "description": "An AMM over Mandala tokens (docs/AMM.md): the overlay engine (shruggr/skein-overlay 0.8.0, required: chain/1) with the Mandala components (shruggr/skein-mandala 0.7.0: the topic manager mandala-topic, one topic per token tm_<txid> and the discovery topic tm_mandala; the lookups ls_mandala and ls_mandala_deploys), the pool liquidity lookup ls_amm (amm-lookup, one service over every token topic, each query naming its token), the validator (amm-validator: swap, addLiquidity, deploy as libp2p direct calls; it submits the signed transaction to its own overlay by message, {fn: \"submit\"} in the box submit (<app>/submit), and answers the call on the engine's answer) and amm-p2p: the validator liveness beacon (a beacon event per validated token topic, tm_<txid>-live, published by the host), the marketplace relay (amm.swap/1, amm.pool/1, amm.liquidity/1: a taker's or an LP's transaction carried to the validator the caller names by identity key and libp2p peer ID, dialled, or handed in-VM to this instance's own amm-validator when that peer is this node) and the pages, www/ served from the app's own tree (skein-sdk files.serve) by the read / (a call: anyone, signed or not, nothing logged; shruggr/skein#135), beside the engine's listing and documentation reads and its derived /lookup; the http rows (/call, the derived /submit) are message routes: a signed request. Anyone submits to the engine by message in the box submit (<app>/submit), and POST /submit admits there too (skein-overlay 0.7.6); the app's own box <app> is amm-p2p's. The manifest declares no topics: the owner registers each token topic with the engine, a message in the app's box register (<app>/register once installed) {fn: \"register\", args: {topic, program: \"mandala-topic\"}}, and drops it with {fn: \"deregister\", args: {topic}}. One setting per token topic (0.3.2): the owner's {fn: \"validate\" | \"unvalidate\", args: {topic}} in the box validate (<app>/validate, admitted from the owner only) puts the topic into (out of) amm-p2p's validated set; for a topic in it the node beacons tm_<txid>-live and amm-validator signs swaps and takes on new liquidity (addLiquidity, deploy), for any other it refuses them not_validating. The owner starts the beacon with the manifest's start, {kind: \"amm-p2p-start\"} in the app's box, and sends it again after a register or deregister. A host serving a market (config.amm.ammP2p.market: true) also asks, at each start, the runtime's liveness tool for the tm_<txid>-live beacons of the tokens it serves ({event: \"liveness\", topic, window: offlineSeconds × 1000}, shruggr/skein#138); the pages read the validators live at GET /amm/.live/tm_<txid>-live and name one in the submit; a stop ends it (unliveness)."
}
